  "skills": [
    {
      "id": "ocr",
      "title": "OCR 解析",
      "desc": "統一圖片入口：VL 模型解析文字 → 分類（名片/賀卡/問安/其他）+ 結構化 JSON 輸出 → 品質檢驗（最多重試 2 次）",
      "color": "#6366f1",
      "tag": "OCR",
      "date": "2026-07-29",
      "icon": "text_snippet",
      "flow": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "ocr-1",
            "type": "trigger",
            "label": "接收圖片",
            "desc": "接收來自 LINE 傳圖或 App 掃描的圖片。\n輸入資料（JSON）：\n• image：圖片內容（LINE 訊息）\n• channelId：LINE channel ID（依 channel 隔離備存）\n• receivedAt：接收時間戳（epoch ms）",
            "color": "#6366f1",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "source": "LINE 圖片"
            },
            "inputs": "觸發：LINE 收到圖片訊息\n{ image, channelId, receivedAt }",
            "outputs": "輸出圖片資料：\n{ imageUri, channelId, receivedAt }"
          },
          {
            "id": "ocr-2",
            "type": "function",
            "label": "儲存圖片至 SeaweedFS",
            "desc": "原始圖片存入 SeaweedFS sam bucket，取得圖片 URI",
            "color": "#22c55e",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "code": "// await saveToSeaweedFS(image, 'sam', {userId, timestamp})",
              "timeout": 10000
            },
            "inputs": "{ image, channelId }",
            "outputs": "{ imageUri: SeaweedFS URI, channelId }"
          },
          {
            "id": "ocr-3",
            "type": "llm",
            "label": "VL 模型 OCR 解析",
            "desc": "調用 Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct，提取圖片中所有可見文字",
            "color": "#f97316",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "model": "Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct",
              "temperature": 0.3,
              "maxTokens": 4096,
              "systemPrompt": "你是一個專業的圖片 OCR 助手，請仔細閱讀圖片中的所有文字內容，並完整輸出。",
              "userPrompt": "請提取此圖片中所有的文字，保持原始排版與順序。"
            },
            "inputs": "{ imageUri, channelId }",
            "outputs": "{ ocr_text: 圖片全部文字 }",
            "propsSchema": [
              {
                "name": "model",
                "label": "模型",
                "type": "select",
                "default": "Qwen3-8B-AWQ",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "label": "Qwen3-8B-AWQ（dllm 預設）",
                    "value": "Qwen3-8B-AWQ"
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct（視覺）",
                    "value": "Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct"
                  }
                ],
                "desc": "LLM 模型。預設走 dllm（localhost:11400），視覺任務用 Qwen2.5-VL。"
              },
              {
                "name": "temperature",
                "label": "溫度",
                "type": "number",
                "default": 0.2,
                "desc": "生成隨機性（0-1），越低越穩定。"
              },
              {
                "name": "maxTokens",
                "label": "最大 Token",
                "type": "number",
                "default": 2048,
                "desc": "輸出長度上限。"
              },
              {
                "name": "systemPrompt",
                "label": "System Prompt",
                "type": "textarea",
                "desc": "系統角色與任務指示。"
              },
              {
                "name": "userPrompt",
                "label": "User Prompt",
                "type": "textarea",
                "desc": "使用者提示（可用 {變數} 帶入上游資料）。"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ocr-4",
            "type": "llm",
            "label": "圖片分類與結構化輸出",
            "desc": "判斷類型並依類型輸出結構化 JSON，含 userAccount、時間、圖片 URI",
            "color": "#f97316",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "model": "dllm 預設",
              "temperature": 0.2,
              "maxTokens": 2048,
              "systemPrompt": "你是一個圖片分類專家。根據 OCR 文字判斷圖片類型，並輸出嚴格 JSON 格式。\n\n類型與輸出格式：\n1. 名片：{ \"type\": \"business_card\", \"content\": { \"name\": \"最大字為姓名\", \"title\": \"職稱\", \"company\": \"公司名稱\", \"phone\": \"手機\", \"tel\": \"公司座機\", \"email\": \"Email\" } }\n   - 注意：名字通常為圖片中最大的字，請優先判斷\n2. 賀卡：{ \"type\": \"greeting_card\", \"content\": { \"festival\": \"節慶名稱\", \"greeting\": \"祝賀語\", \"timestamp\": \"卡片時間\", \"description\": \"賀卡內容描述\" } }\n3. 問安：{ \"type\": \"daily_greeting\", \"content\": { \"period\": \"早/中/晚\", \"greeting\": \"問候語\", \"timestamp\": \"時間\", \"description\": \"問候卡內容描述\" } }\n4. 其他：{ \"type\": \"other\", \"content\": { \"category\": \"業務/其他\", \"description\": \"LLM 描述圖片內容\" } }\n\n所有輸出 JSON 必須包含頂層欄位：\"imageUri\": \"來自 SeaweedFS\", \"userAccount\": \"帳號\", \"timestamp\": \"ISO 時間\"",
              "userPrompt": "OCR 文字：{ocr_text}\n圖片 URI：{image_uri}\n帳號：{user_account}\n\n請分類並輸出 JSON。"
            },
            "inputs": "{ ocr_text, imageUri, channelId, receivedAt }",
            "outputs": "{\n  type: 名片|問安卡|祝福賀卡|其他,\n  name/title/company/phone/email,\n  other_contacts{qq,line,wechat},\n  greeting_period/festival/greeting_content,\n  text\n}",
            "propsSchema": [
              {
                "name": "model",
                "label": "模型",
                "type": "select",
                "default": "Qwen3-8B-AWQ",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "label": "Qwen3-8B-AWQ（dllm 預設）",
                    "value": "Qwen3-8B-AWQ"
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct（視覺）",
                    "value": "Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct"
                  }
                ],
                "desc": "LLM 模型。預設走 dllm（localhost:11400），視覺任務用 Qwen2.5-VL。"
              },
              {
                "name": "temperature",
                "label": "溫度",
                "type": "number",
                "default": 0.2,
                "desc": "生成隨機性（0-1），越低越穩定。"
              },
              {
                "name": "maxTokens",
                "label": "最大 Token",
                "type": "number",
                "default": 2048,
                "desc": "輸出長度上限。"
              },
              {
                "name": "systemPrompt",
                "label": "System Prompt",
                "type": "textarea",
                "desc": "系統角色與任務指示。"
              },
              {
                "name": "userPrompt",
                "label": "User Prompt",
                "type": "textarea",
                "desc": "使用者提示（可用 {變數} 帶入上游資料）。"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ocr-5",
            "type": "condition",
            "label": "品質檢驗",
            "desc": "驗證 JSON 完整性：type 有效、content 非空。失敗可重試最多 2 次",
            "color": "#eab308",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "expression": "檢查 JSON：type in ['business_card','greeting_card','daily_greeting','other'] && content 非空 && imageUri && userAccount && timestamp",
              "outputs": [
                "通過",
                "重試",
                "失敗"
              ]
            },
            "inputs": "{ type, content, imageUri, channelId }",
            "outputs": "{ pass: 通過|重試|失敗 }"
          },
          {
            "id": "ocr-6",
            "type": "dummy",
            "label": "輸出結構化結果",
            "desc": "將結構化 JSON 傳遞至下游技能（名片收集/賀卡/問安/其他）。\n輸出資料（JSON）：\n• summary：圖片概述\n• type：名片 / 問安卡 / 祝福賀卡 / 其他\n• 名片欄位：name / title / company / phone / email / other_contacts{qq,line,wechat}\n• 問安/賀卡：greeting_period（時段） / festival（節慶） / greeting_content（內容）\n• 其他：text（掃描的全部文字）",
            "color": "#94a3b8",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "note": "下游技能依 type 路由"
            },
            "inputs": "{ type, 結構化 JSON（名片/問安/祝福/其他） }",
            "outputs": "結構化 JSON 傳至下游技能（依 type 路由）"
          },
          {
            "id": "ocr-7",
            "type": "function",
            "label": "記錄錯誤日誌",
            "desc": "重試 2 次仍失敗時寫入 Log",
            "color": "#22c55e",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "code": "// logError({imageUri, userAccount, retryCount, error})",
              "timeout": 1000
            }
          }
        ],
        "edges": [
          {
            "source": "ocr-1",
            "target": "ocr-2",
            "label": ""
          },
          {
            "source": "ocr-2",
            "target": "ocr-3",
            "label": ""
          },
          {
            "source": "ocr-3",
            "target": "ocr-4",
            "label": ""
          },
          {
            "source": "ocr-4",
            "target": "ocr-5",
            "label": ""
          },
          {
            "source": "ocr-5",
            "target": "ocr-6",
            "label": "通過"
          },
          {
            "source": "ocr-5",
            "target": "ocr-3",
            "label": "重試 (retryCount < 2)"
          },
          {
            "source": "ocr-5",
            "target": "ocr-7",
            "label": "失敗 (retryCount ≥ 2)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "card-collection",
      "title": "名片收集與回應",
      "desc": "檢查完整性 → 保存至名片夾 → SeaweedFS 連結確認 → LINE 回覆生成 → 檢查完整度 → 回覆",
      "color": "#3b82f6",
      "tag": "Recognition",
      "date": "2026-07-29",
      "icon": "badge",
      "flow": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "card-1",
            "type": "trigger",
            "label": "接收 OCR 結果",
            "desc": "從 OCR 解析技能取得已分類的 JSON 與來源標記",
            "color": "#6366f1",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "source": "OCR 子流程"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-2",
            "type": "condition",
            "label": "① 檢查輸出完整性",
            "desc": "驗證 type=business_card、content、userAccount、timestamp、imageUri",
            "color": "#eab308",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "expression": "type === 'business_card' && content.name && userAccount && timestamp && imageUri",
              "outputs": [
                "通過",
                "不通過"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-3",
            "type": "storage",
            "label": "② 保存至名片夾 (ArangoDB)",
            "desc": "將名片 JSON 寫入 business_cards collection，以 userAccount 隔離租戶",
            "color": "#3b82f6",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "collection": "business_cards",
              "accountIsolation": true,
              "fields": "{\"type\":\"business_card\", \"name\":\"{{content.name}}\", \"title\":\"{{content.title}}\", \"company\":\"{{content.company}}\", \"phone\":\"{{content.phone}}\", \"tel\":\"{{content.tel}}\", \"email\":\"{{content.email}}\", \"imageUri\":\"{{imageUri}}\", \"userAccount\":\"{{userAccount}}\", \"source\":\"{{source}}\", \"timestamp\":\"{{timestamp}}\"}"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-4",
            "type": "function",
            "label": "③ SeaweedFS 連結確認",
            "desc": "驗證 imageUri 指向的圖片在 SeaweedFS 中存在，並建立名片↔圖片關聯",
            "color": "#22c55e",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "code": "// verifySeaweedFS(imageUri) && linkCardToImage(cardId, imageUri)",
              "timeout": 5000
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-5",
            "type": "condition",
            "label": "來源是否為 LINE？",
            "desc": "僅來源為 LINE 傳圖時需自動回覆",
            "color": "#eab308",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "expression": "source === 'LINE 圖片'",
              "outputs": [
                "是 (LINE)",
                "否 (App)"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-6",
            "type": "llm",
            "label": "④ 生成感謝回覆",
            "desc": "使用 dllm 主模型，依 {content.name}{content.title} 生成個人化感謝語",
            "color": "#f97316",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "model": "dllm 預設",
              "temperature": 0.8,
              "maxTokens": 256,
              "systemPrompt": "你是專業的業務助理，請以親切專業的口吻生成一句感謝惠賜名片的回覆。",
              "userPrompt": "請生成一句感謝 {content.name}{content.title} 惠賜名片的回覆，語氣親切專業，不超過 50 字。"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-7",
            "type": "condition",
            "label": "⑤ 檢查回覆完整度",
            "desc": "確認 LLM 有輸出有效內容（非空、長度 ≥ 5）",
            "color": "#eab308",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "expression": "llm_output 非空且長度 ≥ 5",
              "outputs": [
                "完整",
                "不完整"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "card-8",
            "type": "reply",
            "label": "⑥ 正式回覆",
            "desc": "送出 LLM 生成的感謝語",
            "color": "#06b6d4",
            "enabled": true,
            "config": {
              "template": "{llm_output}",
              "fallback": ""
            }
          },
          {
